\q2 \rb has become|הָיְתָ֖ה\rb* \rb a slave|לָמַֽס׃ס\rb*.
\b 
\q1 \v 2 \rb She weeps aloud|בָּכ֨וֹ\rb*\rb |תִבְכֶּ֜ה\rb* \rb in the night|בַּלַּ֗יְלָה\rb*,
\q2 \rb with tears|וְדִמְעָתָהּ֙\rb* \rb upon|עַ֣ל\rb* \rb her cheeks|לֶֽחֱיָ֔הּ\rb*.
