\q2 \rb therefore|עַל־\rb*\rb |כֵּ֖ן\rb* \rb she has become|הָיָ֑תָה\rb* \rb an object of scorn|לְנִידָ֣ה\rb*.
\q1 \rb All|כָּֽל־\rb* \rb who honored her|מְכַבְּדֶ֤יהָ\rb* \rb now despise her|הִזִּיל֙וּהָ֙\rb*,
\q2 \rb for|כִּי־\rb* \rb they have seen|רָא֣וּ\rb* \rb her nakedness|עֶרְוָתָ֔הּ\rb*\rb |גַּם־\rb*;\f + \fr 1:8 \ft Or \fqa her shame\f*
\q2 \rb she herself|הִ֥יא\rb* \rb groans|נֶאֶנְחָ֖ה\rb* \rb and turns|וַתָּ֥שָׁב\rb* \rb away|אָחֽוֹר׃ס\rb*.
\b 
